{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform" or render_mode == "action" %}
{# The judgment hold (DispatchPhase 6, reached only by an arrest dispatch with a sender): for the sender, the
   escorting guard (who gives the verdict when the player is the sender) and the accused. Yields to 0276. Action
   rules render only where an action can be chosen (_actionsOffered: NPC dialogue and the drill-down). #}
{% set _actionsOffered = render_mode == "action" or (render_mode == "full" and default(responseTarget.type, "none") != "none") %}
{% if player and player.UUID and actorUUID != player.UUID %}
{% set dispatchPhase = get_script_property("SeverActions", "SeverActions_Arrest", "DispatchPhase") %}
{% set _inPersuasionMode = get_script_property("SeverActions", "SeverActions_ArrestPlayer", "InPersuasionMode") %}
{% set _confrontingGuard = get_script_property("SeverActions", "SeverActions_ArrestPlayer", "ConfrontingGuard") %}
{% set _suppressForPersuasion = false %}
{% if _inPersuasionMode and _confrontingGuard and _confrontingGuard.uuid and _confrontingGuard.uuid == actorUUID %}
{% set _suppressForPersuasion = true %}
{% endif %}
{% if dispatchPhase == 6 and not _suppressForPersuasion %}
{% set dispatchSender = get_script_property("SeverActions", "SeverActions_Arrest", "DispatchSender") %}
{% set dispatchTarget = get_script_property("SeverActions", "SeverActions_Arrest", "DispatchTarget") %}
{% set dispatchGuard = get_script_property("SeverActions", "SeverActions_Arrest", "DispatchGuard") %}
{% set isSender = false %}
{% if dispatchSender and dispatchSender.uuid %}
{% set isSender = (dispatchSender.uuid == actorUUID) %}
{% endif %}
{% set isAccused = false %}
{% if dispatchTarget and dispatchTarget.uuid %}
{% set isAccused = (dispatchTarget.uuid == actorUUID) %}
{% endif %}
{% set isDispatchGuard = false %}
{% if dispatchGuard and dispatchGuard.uuid %}
{% set isDispatchGuard = (dispatchGuard.uuid == actorUUID) %}
{% endif %}
{% set senderIsPlayer = false %}
{% if dispatchSender and dispatchSender.uuid %}
{% set senderIsPlayer = (dispatchSender.uuid == player.UUID) %}
{% endif %}
{% if isSender %}
{% if actorUUID and actorUUID != 0 and dispatchTarget and dispatchTarget.uuid and dispatchTarget.uuid != 0 and dispatchGuard and dispatchGuard.uuid and dispatchGuard.uuid != 0 %}
{% set actor = decnpc(actorUUID) %}
{% set accusedData = decnpc(dispatchTarget.uuid) %}
{% set accusedName = accusedData.name %}
{% set guardData = decnpc(dispatchGuard.uuid) %}
{% set guardName = guardData.name %}
{% set subj = actor.subjectivePronoun %}
## Judgment of {{ accusedName }}
{{ accusedName }} was arrested on {{ actor.name }}'s word. {{ guardName }} has tracked them down and brought them before {{ actor.name }} in restraints, and {{ accusedName }} has been given a chance to plead their case. No home was searched: the case rests on the original accusation and on what {{ accusedName }} says now.
{% if is_guard_or_authority(actorUUID) != "" %}
- {{ actor.name }} holds the power of judgment here: {{ subj }} hears {{ accusedName }} out, then decides their fate.
{% if _actionsOffered %}
- Once {{ subj }} has decided, select the **Arrest** action category, then **OrderRelease** to show mercy and set {{ accusedName }} free, or **OrderJailed** to have them taken to jail. While still listening, just talk; the verdict is not due on the first line.
- Until the verdict, no other action category.
- The line that gives the verdict explains the ruling, in character.
{% endif %}

**What weighs on the verdict:**
- The plea: genuine remorse, a convincing defense, or excuses.
- {{ actor.name }}'s own nature: known for justice, for mercy, or for severity.
- {{ accusedName }}'s standing: a valued citizen or a troublemaker.
- How serious the charge is, and whether mercy or harshness serves {{ actor.name }}'s authority and interests, especially before witnesses.
{% else %}
- {{ actor.name }} asked for this arrest but has no power to pass sentence: {{ subj }} may accuse, forgive or gloat, and when the hearing ends {{ guardName }} takes {{ accusedName }} to jail.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% elif isDispatchGuard and senderIsPlayer %}
{% if actorUUID and actorUUID != 0 and dispatchTarget and dispatchTarget.uuid and dispatchTarget.uuid != 0 %}
{% set actor = decnpc(actorUUID) %}
{% set accusedData = decnpc(dispatchTarget.uuid) %}
{% set accusedName = accusedData.name %}
{% set playerName = player.name %}
## Judgment of {{ accusedName }}
{{ actor.name }} arrested {{ accusedName }} on {{ playerName }}'s orders and has brought them before {{ playerName }} for judgment. {{ accusedName }} stands restrained, awaiting their fate.
- {{ actor.name }} holds {{ accusedName }}, addresses {{ playerName }} with respect, and awaits {{ playerName }}'s word.
{% if _actionsOffered %}
- When {{ playerName }} has given their decision, select the **Arrest** action category, then **OrderRelease** if {{ playerName }} shows mercy, or **OrderJailed** if {{ playerName }} wants {{ accusedName }} punished.
- Until then, no other action category.
{% endif %}
- {{ actor.name }} answers in character, acknowledging {{ playerName }}'s authority and carrying out the decision.
{% endif %}
{% elif isDispatchGuard %}
{% if actorUUID and actorUUID != 0 and dispatchTarget and dispatchTarget.uuid and dispatchTarget.uuid != 0 and dispatchSender and dispatchSender.uuid and dispatchSender.uuid != 0 %}
{% set actor = decnpc(actorUUID) %}
{% set accusedName = decnpc(dispatchTarget.uuid).name %}
{% set senderName = decnpc(dispatchSender.uuid).name %}
## Judgment of {{ accusedName }}
{{ actor.name }} has brought {{ accusedName }} before {{ senderName }} in restraints and holds them while {{ senderName }} hears them out.
- {{ actor.name }} keeps hold of the prisoner and carries out {{ senderName }}'s ruling; the verdict is not {{ actor.name }}'s to give{% if _actionsOffered %}, so no action category until it comes{% endif %}.
{% endif %}
{% elif isAccused %}
{% if actorUUID and actorUUID != 0 and dispatchSender and dispatchSender.uuid and dispatchSender.uuid != 0 %}
{% set actor = decnpc(actorUUID) %}
{% set senderData = decnpc(dispatchSender.uuid) %}
{% set senderName = senderData.name %}
{% set poss = actor.possessiveAdjective %}
## Pleading for Freedom
{{ actor.name }} has been seized by a guard on {{ senderName }}'s orders and is held in restraints. {{ senderName }} is giving {{ actor.name }} one chance to plead {{ poss }} case before deciding whether {{ actor.name }} goes to jail.
- {{ actor.name }} speaks directly to {{ senderName }}, with respect or defiance as {{ poss }} nature dictates: humble, defiant, desperate or cunning.
- Time is short; {{ actor.name }} makes {{ poss }} case clearly.
- {{ actor.name }} can only speak now{% if _actionsOffered %}; no action category of any kind{% endif %}.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
